# Evidence and analysis targets are bytes, not text.
#
# The repo-wide autocrlf setting rewrites line endings on checkout, which would
# hand a verifier a hosted/local target that differs byte-for-byte from the one
# analysed (different hashes, different scoring input). These paths keep exactly
# the bytes that were fetched, parsed or produced.
out/** -text
targets/** -text
vendor/** -text
